    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Hesai Group describes itself as a global leader in 3D perception and lidar solutions for ADAS and autonomous mobility. The company says its lidar sensors enable physical AI across ADAS, autonomous mobility, robotics, and spatial intelligence, and that it supplies mass-produced lidars to customers in over 40 countries.\n\nOn its website, Hesai positions its lidar as high-resolution 3D perception for intelligent vehicles, supporting features such as AEB (Automated Emergency Braking) and NOA (Navigation on Autopilot). It also describes sensors for L4+ autonomous driving, including robotaxis and robobuses, and says it partners with automotive OEMs, autonomous vehicle, and robotics companies.\n\nHesai Group is a for-profit public company headquartered in Shanghai, trading under ticker HSAI, with SEC CIK 0001861737.",
